# SwiftUI Component Style Guide

Follow these conventions when creating or modifying any SwiftUI View in this project. All design tokens live in `CameraApp/Styles/AppStyle.swift`. Reusable button styles, view modifiers, and components are in `CameraApp/Styles/` and `CameraApp/Components/`.

## Design Tokens — `AppStyle`

Always reference `AppStyle` tokens instead of hard-coding numeric values:

| Category | Token | Value | Use for |
|----------|-------|-------|---------|
| **Corner radius** | `.CornerRadius.badge` | 6 | Badges |
| | `.CornerRadius.pill` | 8 | Small inline buttons |
| | `.CornerRadius.control` | 10 | Inputs, primary buttons, form fields |
| | `.CornerRadius.card` | 14 | Card rows, list items |
| | `.CornerRadius.overlay` | 20 | Detail overlays, sheets |
| **Spacing** | `.Spacing.grid` | 2 | Photo grid inter-item |
| | `.Spacing.tight` | 4 | Tight inline |
| | `.Spacing.compact` | 6 | Label stacks, tab pickers |
| | `.Spacing.small` | 8 | General small gap |
| | `.Spacing.row` | 10 | HStack rows, search bars |
| | `.Spacing.medium` | 12 | Section content |
| | `.Spacing.large` | 24 | Major sections |
| **Padding** | `.Padding.screenHorizontal` | 16 | Screen-level horizontal padding |
| | `.Padding.cardInner` | 12 | Inner card/input padding |
| | `.Padding.buttonVertical` | 14 | Full-width CTA vertical padding |
| | `.Padding.pillHorizontal` | 12 | Pill button horizontal padding |
| | `.Padding.pillVertical` | 6 | Pill button vertical padding |
| | `.Padding.emptyStateTop` | 60 | Empty state top padding |
| | `.Padding.emptyStateHorizontal` | 32 | Empty state side padding |
| **Icon sizes** | `.IconSize.emptyStateIcon` | 36 | SF Symbol in prominent empty states |
| | `.IconSize.emptyStateIconCompact` | 28 | SF Symbol in compact empty states |
| | `.IconSize.tapTarget` | 44 | Minimum tap target |
| | `.IconSize.avatarSmall` | 32 | Small avatars |
| | `.IconSize.avatarMedium` | 48 | Default avatars |
| | `.IconSize.avatarLarge` | 72 | Profile header avatars |
| **Animation** | `.Animation.transition` | easeInOut 0.2s | UI state transitions |
| | `.Animation.spring` | spring 0.3s | Interactive / spring actions |
| | `.Animation.press` | easeInOut 0.15s | Card press effects |

## Colors — Semantic Only

Use **only** semantic/system colors. Never use custom hex values, color literals, or `Color("named")`.

- Text hierarchy: `.primary`, `.secondary`, `.tertiary`, `.quaternary`
- Backgrounds: `Color(.systemBackground)`, `Color(.systemGray5)`, `Color(.secondarySystemGroupedBackground)`
- Surfaces/inputs: `.ultraThinMaterial`
- Semantic accents: `.red` (destructive/liked), `.orange` (pinned/offline)
- Dark/light mode is handled automatically — never branch on `colorScheme`

## Buttons

**Never** use system button styles (`.borderedProminent`, `.bordered`, `.borderless`). Use the app's custom `ButtonStyle` types defined in `CameraApp/Styles/AppButtonStyles.swift`.

| Style | Accessor | Use for |
|-------|----------|---------|
| `AppPrimaryButtonStyle` | `.appPrimary` | Full-width CTAs (Post, Sign In, Add Friend) |
| `AppSecondaryButtonStyle` | `.appSecondary` | Full-width secondary actions (Save, Discard) |
| `AppPillButtonStyle` | `.appPill` | Small inline primary actions (Accept, Add) |
| `AppPillSecondaryButtonStyle` | `.appPillSecondary` | Small inline secondary actions (Pending, Cancel) |
| `AppIconButtonStyle` | `.appIcon` | Circular icon-only buttons (close, dismiss) |
| `MomentCardButtonStyle` | `.momentCard` | Card-level press effects (scale + opacity) |

```swift
Button("Post") { ... }
    .buttonStyle(.appPrimary)

Button("Accept") { ... }
    .buttonStyle(.appPill)

Button { ... } label: { Image(systemName: "xmark") }
    .buttonStyle(.appIcon)
```

`AppPrimaryButtonStyle` handles disabled appearance automatically via `@Environment(\.isEnabled)`.

## View Modifiers

Reusable modifiers in `CameraApp/Styles/AppViewModifiers.swift`:

| Modifier | Applies |
|----------|---------|
| `.cardRow()` | `padding(cardInner)` + `ultraThinMaterial` background + `card` corner radius |
| `.sectionLabel()` | `.subheadline.weight(.semibold)` + `.secondary` foreground |
| `.cardShadow()` | Card-level shadow |
| `.overlayShadow()` | Overlay/sheet shadow |

```swift
Label("Caption", systemImage: "text.bubble")
    .sectionLabel()

HStack { ... }
    .cardRow()
```

## Reusable Components

### `RemoteImage` (`CameraApp/Components/RemoteImage.swift`)

Three-state NukeUI `LazyImage` wrapper. Caller controls sizing.

```swift
RemoteImage(url: post.imageURL)
    .aspectRatio(1, contentMode: .fill)
    .clipped()

RemoteImage(url: post.imageURL, contentMode: .fit)
```

### `AppSearchBar` (`CameraApp/Components/AppSearchBar.swift`)

Reusable search bar with magnifying glass, clear button, and optional loading state.

```swift
AppSearchBar(text: $searchText, placeholder: "Search friends…")

AppSearchBar(
    text: customBinding,
    placeholder: "Search…",
    isLoading: viewModel.isResolving,
    capitalization: .words,
    focusField: $isSearchFocused,
    onClear: { viewModel.dismissSearch() }
)
```

### `EmptyStateView` (`CameraApp/Components/EmptyStateView.swift`)

Centered icon + title + optional subtitle. Two style variants.

```swift
EmptyStateView(icon: "person.2", title: "No Friends Yet", subtitle: "Use the Add Friend tab")

EmptyStateView(icon: "camera", title: "No photos yet", style: .compact)
```

### `AvatarView` (`CameraApp/Components/AvatarView.swift`)

Gradient circle avatar with user initials.

```swift
AvatarView(user: user)                               // default 48pt
AvatarView(user: user, size: AppStyle.IconSize.avatarSmall)   // 32pt
AvatarView(user: user, size: AppStyle.IconSize.avatarLarge)   // 72pt
```

## Typography Hierarchy

| Role | Font |
|------|------|
| Screen title | `.navigationTitle` with `.large` display mode |
| Section header / name | `.title3.weight(.bold)` or `.title3.weight(.semibold)` |
| Primary label | `.subheadline.weight(.semibold)` |
| Body text | `.subheadline` |
| Row label | `.callout.weight(.medium)` |
| Caption / username | `.caption`, `.caption.weight(.semibold)` |
| Tiny metadata | `.caption2`, `.footnote` |
| Form section label | Use `.sectionLabel()` modifier on a `Label` view |

## Navigation

- Wrap screens in `NavigationStack`
- Top-level tabs: `.navigationBarTitleDisplayMode(.large)`
- Detail screens: `.navigationBarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)`
- Row navigation: `NavigationLink(destination:)` + `.buttonStyle(.plain)`
- Toolbar items: `.font(.subheadline).foregroundStyle(.secondary)`

## Shadows

Use the shadow view modifiers or `AppStyle.Shadow` functions:

- Cards: `.cardShadow()` — `shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.08), radius: 8, y: 4)`
- Overlays: `.overlayShadow()` — `shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.15), radius: 10, y: 5)`
- Profile avatars: `shadow(color: <accent>.opacity(0.25), radius: 8, y: 3)`
- Map annotations: `shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.2), radius: 4, y: 2)`
